sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Authorize the request, then correlate its trace
accDescr: A signed call passes IAM authorization before invoking Lambda. Sampled API Gateway and Lambda segments share a trace.
participant Client
participant API as API Gateway
participant Fn as Lambda
participant XR as X-Ray
Client->>API: SigV4 request using role credentials
API->>API: Validate signature and evaluate IAM authorization
alt Permission denied
 API-->>Client: Request rejected
else Permission allowed
 API->>Fn: Invoke with trace context
 Fn-->>API: Response
 API-->>Client: Response
 opt Request sampled
 API-->>XR: API segment
 Fn-->>XR: Function and downstream segments
 end
